  "details": "Open your vrchat camera, take a vertical picture and check your output. It'll be correctly rotated\n\nNow open the vrc+ print camera, take the exact same one, and... it's not rotated.\n\nI use the print camera exclusively because it allows me to check what i just took and share it if good with others around me without adding them on discord or something, and having to rotate hundreds of pictures a week is getting tiring.\n\nThis happens both on live and steam audio beta.",
